{
  "note": [
    "Starter item catalogue. This is a curation job, not a parse job.",
    "",
    "Every row here is provenance 'seed', which means: a plausible id shipped",
    "with the app and NOT yet read back from a live container dump. Treat the",
    "display names as reliable and the ids as unconfirmed.",
    "",
    "Pal soul ids are deliberately absent. The proposal says not to guess them,",
    "and they are the ids most often wrong in community lists. Place one of each",
    "size in a chest in-game and run:",
    "    paleditor dump-chest <container-guid>",
    "then add what comes back with provenance 'confirmed', which the seeder will",
    "never overwrite.",
    "",
    "Ingest also records every unknown id it sees as provenance 'observed', so",
    "the catalogue grows a worklist on its own. An id absent from this file",
    "still renders in the UI as its raw string rather than being hidden."
  ],
